cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SpectraNorm: a Python package for spectral normative modeling"
version: 0.1.4
date-released: "2026-08-24"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for spectral normative modeling of neuroimaging and other
  high-dimensional data. Spectral normative modeling (SNM) leverages
  eigenmodes for efficient spatial reconstruction, generating normative ranges
  for arbitrary regions of interest across spatial scales.
authors:
